{"parentUuid":"d28ea0f8-014e-454f-bc4b-d9ffcd8bc2b1","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"5795a760-cded-424e-abb6-4452014fb503","agentId":"a132b142cbfc5b210","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XCjFgzD3pCwfGK2YaKHd6R","type":"tool_result","content":"Fetched https://uncle.health/interview.html from a non-preapproved source (HTTP 200 OK, text/html, 1520 characters).\n<fetched-web-content>\n  Uncle: meet yourself at 70    \n\nMeet yourself at 70.\n====================\n\nTalk to us for about a minute. We copy your voice, read what you tell us about your money and health, and your future self answers in an older version of your own voice.\n\nFirst, your name\n----------------\n\nWhat should your future self call you? \n\nYour recording goes to ElevenLabs to copy your voice and to Google Gemini to read your answers. It is kept on this server so you don't have to redo it, and you can ask us to delete it. Uncle gives no financial or medical advice.\n\nContinue\n\nNow talk for about a minute\n---------------------------\n\nFind a quiet spot and hold the microphone close. Talk naturally. These help:\n\n1.  Your age, and what you do all day.\n2.  Roughly what you earn, what you have saved, and what you put away each month.\n3.  How often you exercise, how much you sleep, and whether you smoke or drink.\n4.  At what age you'd like to stop working.\n\n0:00\n\nStart recording Stop\n\nAt least 30 seconds gives a better copy of your voice.\n\nWorking on it\n-------------\n\nCopying your voice and reading your answers. This takes a few seconds.\n\nRecord again\n\nDid we get this right?\n----------------------\n\nThis is what we heard. Fix anything that's wrong. Where a box is empty, we use a typical value for your age, not a guess about you.\n\nWhat we heard\n\nThis looks right\n\nYour future self is ready\n-------------------------\n\nOpen the headset page, put the headset on, and say hello.\n\n[Open in the headset](#) [Talk on this computer](/)\n</